# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P7 Sonar, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0. Evan's
# moves (2026-11-13), made before the recording: Osc/Sb to the sub, the sub to -4 oct, drone I's pitch quickly to
# 22 Hz (up from Sonar's 2.7 Hz). The clip is the clicks, held. "# @" marks the listening times (--times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w6
tap PLAY
wait 3000
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
turn K1 85 15
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tapkey b1
tap HOME
tap HOME
turn K1 36 60
wait 1000
wav ticks.wav
# @ P7 Sonar, drone I at 22 Hz, its sub at -4 oct and all sub: clicks, about 3 a second, ringing through Sonar's delay
wait 12000
wavstop
page 5
wait 400
shot ticks-0.png
page 1
wait 400
shot ticks-1.png
